<title>Rainbow scenery review</title><style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}html{color-scheme:dark}body{margin:0;background:#15131c;color:#f6f1f5;font:17px/1.52 Roboto,system-ui,sans-serif}
main{max-width:56rem;padding:1.5rem clamp(1rem,4vw,2.5rem) 4rem;margin:auto}h1{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,7vw,3.2rem);line-height:1.08;margin:.6em 0}h2{margin:1.8em 0 .6em}h3{font-size:1.05rem}a{color:#96e6fe}section{margin:1.4rem 0}p{max-width:72ch}
figure{margin:1.5rem 0 2.2rem}figcaption{font-weight:650;margin:.5rem 0} img,video{display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:3px}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%}td,th{text-align:left;padding:.55rem .45rem;border-bottom:1px solid #48414e}
video{width:min(100%,27rem)} small{color:#d3c9d6}ul{padding-left:1.2rem} .view{border-top:1px solid #48414e;padding:.55rem 0} .view a{display:inline-block;padding:.4rem .7rem .4rem 0}code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}</style></head><body><main><h1>Rainbow scenery review</h1><p>Each screen opens with the original artwork, Claudia’s retained gameplay, and the experimental gameplay at 864 × 1536. The paired rides run from inlet through the stage handoff.</p><section><h2>07 · <a href="Screen-07/index.html">Dive the Washer Tube</a></h2><p><strong>Candidate for owner review.</strong> The third gold paddle now reads as a rounded metal piece during steering. Its photographed front and shaded underside stay on the same solid.</p><p>The magenta banks still straighten during steering and white sides still dominate parts of the plunge. Those changes overlap Claudia’s unfinished bank and plunge work. A small amber transition near the back of the paddle is easiest to inspect at +10.</p><p><a href="Screen-07/APPROVED.jpg">Approved</a> · <a href="Screen-07/BEFORE/opening.png">Claudia before</a> · <a href="Screen-07/NEW/opening.png">Codex new</a></p><p>Hard right · <a href="Screen-07/BEFORE/hard-right.png">Claudia before</a> · <a href="Screen-07/NEW/hard-right.png">Codex new</a></p><p><a href="Screen-07/BEFORE/ride.mp4">Before ride</a> · <a href="Screen-07/NEW/ride.mp4">New ride</a> · <a href="Screen-07.zip">Download this screen</a> · <a href="https://github.com/josiahscalia5-dev/rainbow-/commit/fc13469e0383260dd9a0720581afa538bd53f807">Verified GitHub commit</a></p></section><section><h2>06 · <a href="Screen-06/index.html">Crest the Rinse Arch</a></h2><p><strong>Candidate for owner review.</strong> The rings turn to the right with the tunnel as Benny leaves the crest. The distant passage is easier to follow during forward travel.</p><p>The pale patch under Benny at crest release, long cyan streaks and foam overlapping his lower body still need attention. Some distant rings remain repetitive.</p><p><a href="Screen-06/APPROVED.jpg">Approved</a> · <a href="Screen-06/BEFORE/opening.png">Claudia before</a> · <a href="Screen-06/NEW/opening.png">Codex new</a></p><p>Forward +10 · <a href="Screen-06/BEFORE/forward-10.png">Claudia before</a> · <a href="Screen-06/NEW/forward-10.png">Codex new</a></p><p><a href="Screen-06/BEFORE/ride.mp4">Before ride</a> · <a href="Screen-06/NEW/ride.mp4">New ride</a> · <a href="Screen-06.zip">Download this screen</a> · <a href="https://github.com/josiahscalia5-dev/rainbow-/commit/0478646a45ee68dc81656f0da12baf7f06501bf5">Verified GitHub commit</a></p></section><section><h2>04 · <a href="Screen-04/index.html">Through the Five Arrows</a></h2><p><strong>Candidate for owner review.</strong> The pink banks now sweep across the existing trough as Benny passes the arrows.</p><p>Farther down, the copper corridor and repeated arrows still have less variation than the painted entrance. The separate gold-ring specialist remains a distinct checkpoint.</p><p><a href="Screen-04/APPROVED.jpg">Approved</a> · <a href="Screen-04/BEFORE/opening.png">Claudia before</a> · <a href="Screen-04/NEW/opening.png">Codex new</a></p><p>Forward +10 · <a href="Screen-04/BEFORE/forward-10.png">Claudia before</a> · <a href="Screen-04/NEW/forward-10.png">Codex new</a></p><p><a href="Screen-04/BEFORE/ride.mp4">Before ride</a> · <a href="Screen-04/NEW/ride.mp4">New ride</a> · <a href="Screen-04.zip">Download this screen</a> · <a href="https://github.com/josiahscalia5-dev/rainbow-/commit/13cf566586fb72be002a005bd84fe8cd50bad33f">Verified GitHub commit</a></p></section><section><h2>05 · <a href="Screen-05/index.html">Flow into the Current</a></h2><p><strong>Candidate for owner review.</strong> The perforations read more clearly in close steered views. Their positions and the surrounding reflections stay in place.</p><p>Near the last bend the water still draws into long streaks, and the transition into the next specialist’s environment remains abrupt. This is a wall-detail improvement.</p><p><a href="Screen-05/APPROVED.jpg">Approved</a> · <a href="Screen-05/BEFORE/opening.png">Claudia before</a> · <a href="Screen-05/NEW/opening.png">Codex new</a></p><p>Hard left · <a href="Screen-05/BEFORE/hard-left.png">Claudia before</a> · <a href="Screen-05/NEW/hard-left.png">Codex new</a></p><p><a href="Screen-05/BEFORE/ride.mp4">Before ride</a> · <a href="Screen-05/NEW/ride.mp4">New ride</a> · <a href="Screen-05.zip">Download this screen</a> · <a href="https://github.com/josiahscalia5-dev/rainbow-/commit/8729b96daeb2b73ff27a20b5435fb8eba923d4f2">Verified GitHub commit</a></p></section><section><h2>08 · <a href="Screen-08/index.html">Final Spin Chamber</a></h2><p><strong>Candidate for owner review.</strong> The foreground current now turns under Benny while the door, towel, platform and spouts hold their positions.</p><p>Glossy cyan still stretches at +3, and the near pink bank can dominate the lower frame. The two full-steer collision poses each cost one heart in both builds. The successful inlet-to-exit rides retain all five.</p><p><a href="Screen-08/APPROVED.jpg">Approved</a> · <a href="Screen-08/BEFORE/opening.png">Claudia before</a> · <a href="Screen-08/NEW/opening.png">Codex new</a></p><p>Hard left · <a href="Screen-08/BEFORE/hard-left.png">Claudia before</a> · <a href="Screen-08/NEW/hard-left.png">Codex new</a></p><p><a href="Screen-08/BEFORE/ride.mp4">Before ride</a> · <a href="Screen-08/NEW/ride.mp4">New ride</a> · <a href="Screen-08.zip">Download this screen</a> · <a href="https://github.com/josiahscalia5-dev/rainbow-/commit/19970fa9de964db8836814a57c773a0f45ffde29">Verified GitHub commit</a></p></section><h2>Opening measurements</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Screen</th><th>Before</th><th>New</th><th>Matched views</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>07</td><td>80.046%</td><td>80.046%</td><td>16</td></tr><tr><td>06</td><td>79.086%</td><td>79.092%</td><td>14</td></tr><tr><td>04</td><td>81.840%</td><td>81.840%</td><td>13</td></tr><tr><td>05</td><td>89.442%</td><td>89.442%</td><td>14</td></tr><tr><td>08</td><td>84.086%</td><td>84.086%</td><td>13</td></tr></tbody></table><p>RGB agreement counts every native pixel whose average absolute channel error is at most 20 out of 255. Each screen’s report includes Pixelmatch mismatches and independent repeat measurements. Unpictured moving views are assessed visually.</p><p>All ten selected rides crossed their stage boundary with five hearts. The handoff images match exactly in each before/new pair. Both variants on every screen passed eight gameplay assertions, collected 91 coins and advanced from 1,330 to 2,240. The stock Screen 04 coin route lost one heart in both builds. A separate full-game route finished with five hearts and the same score. Draw calls were unchanged across the captured viewpoints. Screen 05 uses one additional texture. Screen 07 uses two additional textures and draws 368 fewer triangles when the fitted paddle is visible. Physical Android frame times and sustained performance remain to be measured.</p><p><a href="verification.json">Checkpoint and evidence verification</a></p></main></body></html>